WEBVTT

48:03.365 --> 48:06.577
It is true. She does not bleed
for two moons.

48:06.702 --> 48:09.037
Her belly start to swell.

48:10.831 --> 48:13.208
A blessing from the Great Stallion.

48:13.333 --> 48:15.335
WOMAN: She does not want to eat horse.

48:16.420 --> 48:19.173
I'll have the boys
butcher a goat for supper.

48:22.009 --> 48:24.344
(MUTTERS)

48:24.470 --> 48:27.014
I need to ride to Qohor.
